** Traffic Advisory**

Expect delays along I-5 n/b at Encinitas Blvd Offramp and along Encinitas Blvd (Encinitas). Crews are working to recover a large semi-truck tractor trailer. Please drive safely and use caution in the area.  #TrafficAlert #CHP #CommuteTraffic
